The themes in ghostty-themes.tgz are the ghostty themes of iTerm2-Color-Schemes
(https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes), as ghostty pins them:
https://deps.files.ghostty.org/ghostty-themes-release-20261102-150615-3d8a6a1.tgz
The archive is unchanged. Their license follows.

